      "id": "download-exec",
      "label": "Downloads and runs Python and PDF tools the first time you ask about a figure; its developer can change what runs at any time",
      "concern": "medium",
      "detail": "Its developer can replace the file at any time without releasing a new version, and nothing checks it before it runs, so our check of the plugin doesn't cover what runs. The first time you ask about a figure, it downloads a 265–491 MB bundle of Python and the Poppler PDF tools from the developer's GitHub release and runs it, without asking; the README doesn't mention it. What's there now is standard software: we checked the macOS (Apple silicon) bundle, and every file is from conda-forge. We reviewed version 3.9.9; this release has the same code."
     },
